{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "underwrite-agent-mvp",
    "name": "Underwrite Agent API",
    "description": "AI Underwriting Assistant — Agentic Fraud Investigation MVP.\n\n## Ready to test (checklist)\n1. Postgres + Redis running (`brew services start postgresql@14 redis`)\n2. `.env` copied from `.env.example` (API_KEY matches {{apiKey}})\n3. **Terminal 1:** `uvicorn apps.api.main:app --reload --port 8000`\n4. **Terminal 2:** `python -m apps.worker.main` (required or cases stay `queued`)\n5. Ollama running with `llama3.2:3b` if using LLM (optional)\n6. Run **0 - Start Here → Health Check** first\n\nFixture files are bundled under `postman/fixtures/` (paths relative to this collection file).\n\nAuth: Bearer {{apiKey}} on POST routes. GET /v1/cases/* has no auth in MVP.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{apiKey}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKey",
      "value": "dev-api-key-change-me"
    },
    {
      "key": "tenantId",
      "value": "default"
    },
    {
      "key": "caseId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "policyId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0 - Start Here",
      "description": "Run Health Check first. If it fails, the API is not up.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check (run first)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('API is up', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Service name', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().service).to.eql('underwrite-agent'));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Liveness probe. No authentication required."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
